  "description": "A comprehensive in-memory Gremlin-compatible graph database implementation for Stardust.Paradox.Data. Perfect for unit testing, integration testing, and rapid prototyping. Features a powerful scenario framework for easy test data setup, full Gremlin query support, and seamless integration with existing Paradox applications.",
