  "releaseNotes": "Preview Release 1.0.0-preview.1: Full in-memory Gremlin query execution engine with comprehensive scenario framework for test data setup. Built-in scenarios for Social Network, E-Commerce, Organization, User Management. Fluent API for easy connector creation and configuration. Custom scenario support with extensible provider pattern. High-performance graph traversals and aggregations. Complete documentation and usage examples. Compatible with .NET Standard 2.0 and higher.",
